    "%lld frames couldn't be aligned and never entered the model — only %lld%% were used. When walking, the most common causes are motion blur and fast turns: pause briefly while rotating the phone and add light. Empty flat walls also leave no pattern to match." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%1$lld frames couldn't be aligned and never entered the model — only %2$lld%% were used. When walking, the most common causes are motion blur and fast turns: pause briefly while rotating the phone and add light. Empty flat walls also leave no pattern to match."
          }
        }
      }
    },
