    "%lld photos couldn't be aligned and never entered the model. The most common cause is light rotating with the object: as the object turns, shadows slide across the surface and the solver can't match the same point in two frames. Make the light soft from all sides, or rotate the lamp with the object." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "%lld photos couldn't be aligned and never entered the model. The most common cause is light rotating with the object: as the object turns, shadows slide across the surface and the solver can't match the same point in two frames. Make the light soft from all sides, or rotate the lamp with the object."
          }
        }
      }
    },
