    "Capture is good: frames aligned. The low quality isn't the capture — it's the on-device `reduced` level: ~25,000 triangles and a single texture spread over the whole surface. Plenty for a small product, far too few for anything bigger. Frames are saved: reprocessing on a Mac at `.raw` is the real fix." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Capture is good: frames aligned. The low quality isn't the capture — it's the on-device `reduced` level: ~25,000 triangles and a single texture spread over the whole surface. Plenty for a small product, far too few for anything bigger. Frames are saved: reprocessing on a Mac at `.raw` is the real fix."
          }
        }
      }
    },
